#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_cash_management_control.field_res_config_settings__pos_pcm_closing_mode
msgid ""
"How the closing cash of a session is counted:\n"
"- Standard Count: the cashier sees the expected cash and the difference.\n"
"- Blind Count: cashiers enter the counted cash without seeing the expected amount or the difference; POS managers keep full visibility.\n"
"- No Count: the server records the expected cash as counted; no difference is posted."
msgstr ""

#. module: pos_cash_management_control
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pos_cash_management_control.res_config_settings_view_form
