#. module: pos_cash_management_control
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_cash_management_control.field_pos_config__pcm_opening_mode
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_cash_management_control.field_pos_session__pcm_opening_mode
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_cash_management_control.field_res_config_settings__pos_pcm_opening_mode
msgid ""
"How the opening cash of a session is determined:\n"
"- Standard Count: the cashier counts the cash; Odoo pre-fills the last closing balance.\n"
"- Count with Suggested Fixed Float: the cashier counts the cash; the fixed float is pre-filled and the gap with the last closing balance is booked as a float transfer.\n"
"- Open on Server with Last Closing Balance: no count, the session opens with the last closing balance (the very first session falls back to a standard count).\n"
"- Open on Server with Fixed Float: no count, the session opens with the fixed float and the gap with the last closing balance is booked as a float transfer."
msgstr ""

